### REST Client Examples for Ursol CAST API
### Variables and Environment Setup

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = your_bearer_token_here
@contentType = application/json

###
### ============================================
### HACIENDA INTEGRATION - COMPROBANTES ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
###

### 1. Crear Comprobante (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tipo_comprobante": 1,
  "numero_documento_emisor": "10102050126",
  "numero_documento_receptor": "40202180003",
  "monto_total": 25000.00,
  "monto_impuesto": 5000.00,
  "moneda": "CRC",
  "referencia": "INV-001-2025",
  "descripcion": "Venta de servicios de consultoría",
  "datos_adicionales": {
    "fecha_servicio": "2025-02-08",
    "condiciones_pago": "Contado",
    "cliente_nombre": "ACME Corporation"
  }
}

### 2. Listar todos los Comprobantes (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Listar Comprobantes con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes?page=1&per_page=15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Filtrar Comprobantes por estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes?estado=pendiente
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Obtener Comprobante específico (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Actualizar Comprobante (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "numero_documento_receptor": "40202180003",
  "monto_total": 30000.00,
  "monto_impuesto": 6000.00,
  "descripcion": "Venta de servicios - updated"
}

### 7. Devolver Comprobante (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================
### HACIENDA - FIRMA CON XADES-EPES
### ============================================
###

### 8. Firmar Comprobante con certificado digital
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1/firmar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "certificado_numero": "3010600030103",
  "pin": "1234",
  "fecha_firma": "2025-02-08T14:30:00Z",
  "tipo_firma": "xades-epes"
}

### 9. Verificar estado de firma
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1/estado-firma
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Obtener XML generado
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/1/xml
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================
### RATE LIMITING - TEST ENDPOINTS
### ============================================
###

### Test Rate Limiting - API (60 requests/minute)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@@ 
# Repetir 5 veces seguidas para probar rate limiting
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@@ 
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@@ 
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@@ 
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================
### ENCRYPTION TEST - DATOS SENSIBLES
### ============================================
###

### Crear Comprobante con datos encriptados
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tipo_comprobante": 1,
  "numero_documento_emisor": "10102050126",
  "numero_documento_receptor": "40202180003",
  "monto_total": 50000.00,
  "monto_impuesto": 10000.00,
  "email_receptor": "cliente@example.com",
  "telefono_receptor": "87654321",
  "banco_numero_cuenta": "12345678901",
  "banco_codigo_swift": "BANCES2R",
  "banco_cif": "A12345678"
}

###
### ============================================
### AUDIT LOG - HISTORIAL DE CAMBIOS
### ============================================
###

### Obtener logs de auditoría para Comprobantes
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?model=HaciendaComprobante&action=created
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener logs por usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?user_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener logs por tipo de operación
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?action=updated&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================
### ESTATÍSTICAS Y REPORTES
### ============================================
###

### Obtener estadísticas de Hacienda
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/estadisticas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener resumen por período
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/estadisticas?fecha_inicio=2025-01-01&fecha_fin=2025-02-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Descargar reporte en Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/export/excel?formato=xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### ============================================
### ERROR HANDLING - TEST CASOS DE ERROR
### ============================================
###

### Test 404 - Comprobante no existe
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test 422 - Validación fallida (monto negativo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "tipo_comprobante": 1,
  "numero_documento_emisor": "10102050126",
  "numero_documento_receptor": "40202180003",
  "monto_total": -1000.00,
  "monto_impuesto": -200.00
}

### Test 429 - Rate limit exceeded (después de muchas llamadas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hacienda/comprobantes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

